# Claude Workspace — scoped Git tracking.
# We track the SYSTEM LAYER only: context, frameworks, skills, preferences,
# bootstrap (installer + integration docs + Obsidian templates), vault config,
# CLAUDE.md, MOCs, and the 00-obsidian project (this integration's docs).
# Everything else is intentionally excluded — artifacts, project work, tools, vendor files.

# ---- Ignore by default ----
*

# ---- But track these ----
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

# Universal agent contract + per-tool adapters (portable, LLM-agnostic layer).
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!PERPLEXITY.md
!CURSOR.md
!README.md
!llms.txt

# Maps of Content (Obsidian navigation layer)
!_HOME.md
!_MOC.md
!_PROJECTS.md
!_SKILLS.md
!_FRAMEWORKS.md
!_CONTEXT.md
!_CHEATSHEET.md

# Copilot skill pack (Claude slash wrappers point here via relative symlinks)
!copilot/
!copilot/**

!.claude/
!.claude/**

!.cursor/
!.cursor/**
!.cursorignore

!.obsidian/
!.obsidian/**

!.github/
!.github/**

!00-bootstrap/
!00-bootstrap/**

!01-frameworks/
!01-frameworks/**

!02-shared-references/
!02-shared-references/**

!03-skills/
!03-skills/**

!04-preferences/
!04-preferences/**

!06-context/
!06-context/**

# Transient per-session files (regenerated each session; machine-local, not shared).
# The .md session fragments and the README ARE tracked — only these are ignored.
06-context/sessions/*.touched
06-context/sessions/*.alive
# Ephemeral side-chat → parent inbox (one pending slot; see side-chat-handback skill)
06-context/side-chat-inbox.md

# Archive (retired files + provenance ledger). Tracked so provenance is auditable.
!_archive/
!_archive/**

!08-knowledge/
!08-knowledge/**

# 09-tools/ stays mostly local (vendor + per-machine tools), but selectively
# track the cross-machine, portable utilities so they're version-controlled.
!09-tools/
!09-tools/README.md
!09-tools/build-registry.py
!09-tools/build-related.py
!09-tools/validate-links.py
!09-tools/validate-workspace.py
!09-tools/validate-integrity.py
!09-tools/validate-capabilities.py
!09-tools/build-trigger-routes.py
!09-tools/build-local-skill-plugin.py
!09-tools/compact-sessions.py
!09-tools/vault-health.py
!09-tools/vault-retrieve.py
!09-tools/vault-retrieve.golden.json
!09-tools/check-terminology.py
!09-tools/check-unattended-runner-gate.py
!09-tools/side-chat-handback.py
!09-tools/test-validators.py
!09-tools/ds-source-watch.py
!09-tools/evaluate-skill-routing.py
!09-tools/cursor-externalize.py
!09-tools/generate-display-svg.py
!09-tools/eslint-off-system/
!09-tools/eslint-off-system/**
!09-tools/fixtures/
!09-tools/fixtures/**

# Track only the 00-obsidian integration project; other projects stay local.
!07-projects/
!07-projects/00-obsidian/
!07-projects/00-obsidian/**

# Track the portable bootstrap generator — pilot for git-native (non-gdrive) projects.
!07-projects/18-bootstrap-generator/
!07-projects/18-bootstrap-generator/**
# …but NOT its build artifacts (the `**` whitelist above would otherwise re-include
# them despite the project's own .gitignore). dist/ = generated zips + .app bundle.
07-projects/18-bootstrap-generator/dist/
07-projects/18-bootstrap-generator/**/__pycache__/

# Track the workspace-brain project — standing home for workspace-subject sessions;
# cross-machine continuity is its entire point (framework #08, 2026-07-09).
!07-projects/19-workspace-brain/
!07-projects/19-workspace-brain/**

# Track the LCARS generative interface project — design SPEC + session continuity
# (2026-08-07). Implementation code stays in the platform Projects directory.
!07-projects/20-lcars-generative-interface/
!07-projects/20-lcars-generative-interface/**

# Track the ShadeGraph shader-tool project — design docs + session continuity
# (2026-09-04). Implementation code stays in the platform Projects directory (~/Projects/ShadeGraph).
!07-projects/21-shadegraph/
!07-projects/21-shadegraph/**

# MediaSentinel is otherwise git-local; track only Cursor canvas copies.
!07-projects/01-mediaservices/
!07-projects/01-mediaservices/canvases/
!07-projects/01-mediaservices/canvases/**

# ---- Still ignored, even inside tracked folders ----

# 07-projects tracking policy (2026-09-04) — applies inside ANY tracked project folder.
# Project CONTEXT (reference, guidance, intent, curated media, docs) IS tracked, for
# both personal AND work projects. NEVER tracked, even inside a tracked project folder:
#   • company/app CODE or checked-out repos → live in their own repos (centric-ui,
#     prototype repos, ~/Projects/*), never the workspace.
#   • sensitive customer data → never in the workspace at all; keep it with the employer repo.
#   • dependencies / build output / regenerated capture dumps / heavy media.
# New project folders are opted in individually (allowlist above) only AFTER a triage
# confirms no only-copy code and no customer data. Full policy + migration status:
# 08-knowledge/cross-domain/workspace-infrastructure.md.
07-projects/**/node_modules/
07-projects/**/dist/
07-projects/**/build/
07-projects/**/.next/
07-projects/**/target/
07-projects/**/__pycache__/
07-projects/**/*.pyc
07-projects/**/.tmp-*
07-projects/**/refs/
07-projects/**/Video/

# Per-user permission grants (machine-local; never share)
.claude/settings.local.json
**/settings.local.json

# Claude Code transient
.claude/sessions/
.claude/logs/
.claude/projects/

# Claude Code per-session worktrees (auto-generated, machine-local)
**/.claude/worktrees/

# Per-machine dispatcher state (claude-version pin, etc.)
.claude/state/

# Obsidian runtime state (per-device, not shared)
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache
.obsidian/graph-*.json.bak

# Obsidian plugin runtime data — auto-modified while Obsidian is open, not user-authored
.obsidian/core-plugins.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json
# …except obsidian-git's config — tracked so git-sync behavior is identical on every device
# (portable: basePath/gitDir are empty, no machine-specific paths). Expect occasional churn.
!.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-git/data.json

# Obsidian plugin binaries — installed by setup.py, not versioned
.obsidian/plugins/*/main.js
.obsidian/plugins/*/manifest.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/styles.css

# Daily notes — local to each machine
05-artifacts/active/daily/

# Cloud-storage virtual shortcuts + metadata (not real bytes; git can't read them)
**/desktop.ini
**/.DS_Store
**/*.gdoc
**/*.gsheet
**/*.gslides
**/*.gform
**/*.gdraw
**/*.gtable
**/*.glink
**/*.gnote
**/*.gscript
**/*.gmap
**/*.gjam

# OS temp files
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*~

# Python bytecode
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# macOS custom folder-icon files (Finder / cloud-sync tools create these in every
# folder; they pollute git status and block `git pull --rebase` every session).
Icon?
**/Icon?
